        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>increase, enlarge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῦτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.150
				</span></i>
			 (where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυχοὺς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenoph.
					2.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make wanton</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ ἦ σ᾽ ἐπίανέν
				τις ἄπτερος φάτις</span>; <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				276
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰ πάθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					1.34
				</span></i>
			 :— 
				Pass.
			, <i>wax fat and wanton</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶσσε, πιαίνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1669
				</span></i>
			 (anap.) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχθεσιν πιαίνεσθαι</span>
			<i>batten on</i> quarrels, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.56
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόνῳ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				B.
				3.68
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>cherish, cheer</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππον . . π. ὁ τοῦ δεσπότου ὀφθαλμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1345a3
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἑὴν φρένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					5.372
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				620
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάστακα π. χείλεος εὐαφίῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.293.16
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>).—Rare in Prose.</div>
